      "content": "i dont think a support group is going to help with this. it's not just being tired, it's like... i feel like i'm just a ghost living in this room. sometimes i lie here staring at the ceiling and i just think about how peaceful it would be if i could just sleep and never wake up. like if i could just opt out of all of this and finally have some rest. does that make me a monster? it just seems like the only way to actually find peace.",
